{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1000_018ele", "source_sha256": "d2a7e34d242407e6cd025e710a4fbd3df1809346620f658dec9e70a7717f02f9", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}！\nエヘヘ、ぎゅーっ！", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}！\n嘿嘿，我抱～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2916c24e31ced80de9c8277ec243a630ca63f11412fa553658a0913dc6e391ff", "ja": "エレナ、そんなにくっつかなくても聞こえるよ。\nというか、今日はちょっと、くっつき過ぎじゃないか？", "zh": "埃琳娜，不用贴得这么紧我也听得到。\n应该说，你今天是不是有点贴太紧啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "c689c5b814b63ef1aae28e808e97c76cbd296b13e29274ef9fa16012ab1bba49", "ja": "え～。{$P$}、\nワタシがくっついてたら、ダメなノ？", "zh": "咦～{$P$}，\n我不能贴这么紧吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1003_p", "source_sha256": "387fe7c5bbaf4e9b0711b842c34d9317d2695025119d0f5999bd189d1b1c2718", "ja": "ダメってわけじゃないけど……\nなにか、理由があるのか？", "zh": "也不是不行啦……\n有什么理由吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "cc948c209f9ace9296558a0497149681c2654b3837d40e684f0c98496971348d", "ja": "うーん……。何かあったワケじゃないんだケド、\n1人で街を歩くのが、ちょっぴり怖いナって……。", "zh": "嗯……也没有什么特别的理由，\n只是一个人走在街上，让我有点怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "222b4cc5eb13165f3ed5af8cc703768b4954b2e7b4ba227831ac053a90d3e1d6", "ja": "前みたいに、黒いオジさんが\n急に話しかけてきたら……困るでしょ？", "zh": "要是黑色叔叔像之前一样突然来搭话……\n那不就伤脑筋了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1006_p", "source_sha256": "445a00fd2a416b2d70e8656e74e4820294d71dc84ac189a7d749860a09b13110", "ja": "黒いオジさん……ああ、黒井社長のことか。\nそれは確かに困るし、びっくりするな。", "zh": "黑色叔叔……喔，你是说黑井社长啊。\n那的确是很让人伤脑筋，也会吓一跳吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "dafe5baeb18ee97724185f8106f4d385bad322492b889845672fd15e1afbb2d5", "ja": "でも{$P$}と一緒なら、\n怖くないヨ♪", "zh": "可是跟{$P$}在一起，\n我就不怕了喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1008_p", "source_sha256": "543bd2c170f8b7da2e7345ee3c2d6e27e4fd7c440edde70261d6c7ff8cdaeca1", "ja": "それはよかった。でも、もうそんなに\n黒井社長を怖がる必要はないからな？", "zh": "那就好。\n不过，现在已经没必要那么害怕黑井社长啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "002cf1452f69392492428c13e7e5b93b850a19d3873e3a3900795864051b438f", "ja": "？　どうして？", "zh": "为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c434c26e5be21360ab9c789de4f1699e96a79ed3686fe18a761f8b20d31e5f9e", "ja": "エレナも莉緒も、誘いをはっきり断ったからだよ。\nスカウトするのは、もうあきらめてると思う。", "zh": "因为埃琳娜和莉绪都已经果断地拒绝了啊。\n我想，他应该已经放弃来挖角你们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "fee985b7b31abbef87e34d90ec437415592224cc602945bd44de0dafdb9a41c5", "ja": "そっか～。ウン、そうだよネ！", "zh": "这样啊～嗯，说得也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "a96a475e556812066543a4f4ff74e659b9c78c9a1032b5f0fd7e373e993d3b9a", "ja": "ありがと、{$P$}！\nもっとくっついてもイイ？", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！\n我还可以再多贴着你一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1013_p", "source_sha256": "85fb946715454d6a6d78f88ea7e71593e9f7e824e43b4f744d898b24c1b28ef5", "ja": "えっ。なんでそうなるんだ？", "zh": "咦，为什么要这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "fcd478fa6da78b73bf9963a9eab044977af7650d340262a3c231dd053f203531", "ja": "ありがとうのハグ、したいだけ！\nでも、ここじゃダメなノ？", "zh": "只是想给你感谢的拥抱！\n不过，在这里不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6266eea206e519ed6685b7c00464d06aac7ed2e9625c7dc143c6739bdf9ac5f0", "ja": "い、いや、どこでも困るけど……。そもそも、\n俺がお礼を言われることじゃない気がするけど？", "zh": "不、不是，在哪我都很困扰……话说回来，\n我觉得这件事本来就用不着跟我道谢啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "96f7833bdb227c32de057e14f2b53254404ea877b5b2462353a7fa1de889b10e", "ja": "そんなことないヨ？　エレナも莉緒も、黒いオジさんに\nハッキリ言えたのは、765プロが大好きだからナノ！", "zh": "没那回事喔！埃琳娜和莉绪之所以能果断地\n拒绝黑色叔叔，是因为我们最喜欢765艺能了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0043_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "6b2f12221e0e3ce89b27e2e11ba6886be313d76cf29abda9327e0a4e7970f75a", "ja": "大好きになれたのは{$P$}のおかげ！\nだから……エヘヘ、ぎゅーっ♪", "zh": "而且是多亏有{$P$}在，\n我们才会喜欢上这里！所以……嘿嘿，我抱～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
